OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMild and humid during the
OL,6,Fmorning, as a weakening band of rain
OL,7,Fmoves southeast. Becoming drier,
OL,8,Fbrighter and fresher through the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with a breeze and some warm
OL,10,Fsunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear spells,
OL,13,Fthough more cloud in the north or west
OL,14,Fat times. Wind easing light inland but
OL,15,Fbreezy near the north Norfolk coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FBright and dry through the
OL,18,Fmorning, more cloud developing during
OL,19,Fthe afternoon with scattered showers,
OL,20,Ffurther north, largely dry in the
OL,21,Fsouth. Moderate westerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
